This README file contains a brief description of the verification case.

A simple test for a 1mm x 1mm x 1mm case with:

Temperature: 600K
fast neutron flux: 5e17 n/m²/s
fluxConversionFactor:1
stress:50 MPa

The  K = 2e-37
So the creep_rate = K*stress*flux*fluxConversionFactor = 5E-12 /s
creep_strain at 2e8 s = 0.001

The average creep_strain obtained by OFFBEAT is 9.99999361E-4, the relative error is 6.37e-5%.
